      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">The practical stuff</p>
        <h2>How our working day <span>overlaps with yours, city by city</span></h2>
        <p class="lead">Manila is UTC+8. Sydney and Melbourne are UTC+10 (UTC+11 in daylight saving). Brisbane is UTC+10 year-round. Perth is UTC+8, exactly the same as us.</p>
        <p>Our published office hours are Monday to Friday, 9:00 to 18:00 Manila time, and the Philippines has no daylight saving, so only your clock changes. We arrange calls within the overlap and confirm delivery dates separately, including time for your feedback and any developer dependencies.</p>
