        <h3>A typical working day</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>9:00 Manila</strong>: 11:00 in Sydney and Melbourne on AEST, or 12:00 on AEDT</li>
          <li><strong>18:00 Manila</strong>: our day closes at 20:00 on AEST, or 21:00 on AEDT</li>
          <li><strong>11:00 Brisbane / 9:00 Manila</strong>: Queensland stays on AEST year-round</li>
